  "description": "LG webOS Signage RS232C-over-IP protocol library (TCP 9761). Reads identity (serial, MAC, firmware, model) and reads/writes power, input source, energy saving, DPM, volume, mute, ISM method and PM mode on LG signage panels. Includes a model-name → webOS Signage platform-version lookup for provisioning flows.",
  "id": "Adzup.LgControl",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-07-30T20:42:00.51Z",
