  "projectUrl": "https://adzup.net/",
  "published": "2026-07-30T20:38:53.79Z",
  "releaseNotes": "Initial release. Get/Set command pairs for ka, xb, jq, dn, kf, ke, kj, dz plus identity gets fy, ft, fz, fv. GET returns the same string tokens SET accepts; unknown codes round-trip as \"0x<hex>\". LgPlatformVersions.FromModel maps model names to webOS Signage platform versions per LG's hardware-specifications table.",
